+ '**The JIT designs**: %d of the front, %d of its fastest tenth\'s %d; %s.' % (len(J), len(fj), k, genes), '',
+ '**The fast end re-measured** (remeasure.json, %d designs): the fastest ten %s re-measured / in-run, the JIT designs %s, the rest %s.' % (
